1. Install Package chrony
yum install chrony -y

2. Start and enable chronyd service
systemctl enable chronyd --now

3. Just make sure exiting source of time
chronyc sources -v

3. Make configuration in /etc/chrony.conf
vim /etc/chrony.conf
   
server   ip_address_server/FQDN  iburst
save & quit

4. Restart chronyd service
systemctl restrat chronyd

5. Check the status
chronyc sources -v
